## 변경 상세

### 1. `AboutProofRenderer.ts` — `selectProofItems` 확장 (line 68–81)

현재 로직은 awarded+video → awarded+image → non-awarded+video만 포함.
`thumbnailImage`가 있는 일반 항목을 마지막 순위로 추가해 thumb_image가 있으면 모두 포함.

```typescript
// Before
function selectProofItems(items: WorkApiItem[], max: number): WorkApiItem[] {
  const awardedVideo = items.filter((i) => i.isAwarded && i.thumbnailVideo);
  const awardedImage = items.filter((i) => i.isAwarded && !i.thumbnailVideo);
  const daegiyeopVideo = items.filter((i) => !i.isAwarded && i.thumbnailVideo);

  const result: WorkApiItem[] = [...awardedVideo];
  if (result.length < MIN_PROOF_ITEMS) result.push(...awardedImage);
  if (result.length < MIN_PROOF_ITEMS) result.push(...daegiyeopVideo);
  return result.slice(0, max);
}

// After
function selectProofItems(items: WorkApiItem[], max: number): WorkApiItem[] {
  const awardedVideo  = items.filter((i) => i.isAwarded && i.thumbnailVideo);
  const awardedImage  = items.filter((i) => i.isAwarded && !i.thumbnailVideo && i.thumbnailImage);
  const otherVideo    = items.filter((i) => !i.isAwarded && i.thumbnailVideo);
  const otherImage    = items.filter((i) => !i.isAwarded && !i.thumbnailVideo && i.thumbnailImage);

  const result: WorkApiItem[] = [...awardedVideo];
  if (result.length < max) result.push(...awardedImage);
  if (result.length < max) result.push(...otherVideo);
  if (result.length < max) result.push(...otherImage);
  return result.slice(0, max);
}
```

### 2. `AboutProofRenderer.ts` — `_loadItemMedia` 이미지 소스 변경 (line 233)

`fileAttach1 || thumbnailImage` → `thumbnailImage` 단독 사용 (THUMB_IMAGE 우선).

```typescript
// Before
const imageUrl = item.fileAttach1 || item.thumbnailImage;

// After
const imageUrl = item.thumbnailImage;
```

### 3. `AboutProofRenderer.ts` — 카드 크기 확대 (line 10)

`CARD_HEIGHT` 1.8 → 2.6 (약 44% 확대). 가로는 16:9 비율 자동 연동.

```typescript
// Before
const CARD_HEIGHT = 1.8;

// After
const CARD_HEIGHT = 2.6;
```

### 4. `InfiniteGalleryRenderer.ts` — 갤러리 스크롤 속도 감소 (line 17)

`SCROLL_SPEED` 2.5 → 0.6 (약 75% 감소). 휠/터치/키보드 모두 이 상수를 공유.

```typescript
// Before
const SCROLL_SPEED = 2.5;

// After
const SCROLL_SPEED = 0.6;
```

